{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2022-05-18 08:00:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS RANKED AMONG 100 BEST CORPORATE CITIZENS', 'text': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS ONE OF ONLY 19 COMPANIES TO MAKE LIST EVERY YEAR SINCE 2009 MOVES UP FROM #33 TO #21 IN OVERALL RANKING JOHNSON CONTROLS RANKS SECOND WITHIN CAPITAL GOODS SECTOR CORK, IRELAND , MAY 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JOHNSON CONTROLS, THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, IS PROUD TO ONCE AGAIN BE NAMED A 100 BEST CORPORATE CITIZEN IN THE 2022 RANKINGS. WITH THIS IMPORTANT RECOGNITION, JOHNSON CONTROLS BECOMES ONE OF ONLY 19 COMPANIES THAT HAVE MADE THE LIST EVERY YEAR SINCE 2009.'}